    "source": "Same quantity on both sides: done, result type, face count, valid and volume of the BiTgte blend of edge 0 of the 100x80x60 box at r=5. Bridge: Shape.biTgteBlend non-nil (OCCTBiTgteBlend returns nullptr when BiTgte_Blend is not done or the shape is null), shapeType (ordinal 3, TopAbs_SHELL), faces().count, isValid and Shape.volume; the test asserts a non-nil result (try #require), the SHELL type, 6 faces and the volume; the type is what tells the kernel's shell from the input solid handed back unchanged. Kernel: BiTgte_Blend(box, r, 1e-3, false) with SetEdge on the same TopExp edge-map indices and Perform(true), IsDone, TopAbs::ShapeTypeToString, a TopExp_Explorer face count, BRepCheck_Analyzer, BRepGProp::VolumeProperties; blendBoxEdge line of the transcript at %.17g. Doubles are compared to 1e-9 relative.",
